WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.730 line:73%
6 kWp na solar, 6 kW na
inverter. Pareho ba 'yan?

c02
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.950 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:14.630 line:73%
Hindi. Ang kWp ay DC rating
ng panels sa test conditions.

c04
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:20.350 line:73%
Ang kW ng inverter ay AC
output na kaya nitong ilabas.

c05
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.240 line:73%
Puwedeng mas malaki ang
panels kaysa inverter.

c06
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.840 line:73%
Tinatawag itong
DC-to-AC ratio.

c07
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.490 line:73%
Kapag sobra ang DC sa
tanghali, may clipping.

c08
00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:32.880 line:73%
Normal 'yan, basta tama
ang design at kalkula.

cz1
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.870 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.400 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
